{"seq":3,"slug":"background-sync","title":"后台同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/offline-data/background-sync","wordCount":1558,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"后台同步\">后台同步</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Background Sync API 允许 PWA 在用户离线时注册同步任务，浏览器在网络恢复后（即使页面已关闭）自动触发 Service Worker 处理这些任务。这意味着用户离线提交表单、发送消息不会丢失——Service Worker 会在后台自动重试直到成功。本节涵盖 Background Sync API 的使用、一次性同步与周期性同步的区别、Workbox BackgroundSyncPlugin 集成、与同步队列的协作，以及各项限制。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一次性同步（One-off Sync）</td>\n<td>网络恢复时</td>\n<td>提交待处理的表单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期性同步（Periodic Sync）</td>\n<td>定期触发</td>\n<td>每日刷新新闻内容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"一次性后台同步\">一次性后台同步</h2><p><strong>在主线程中注册同步任务</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"async function postTask(task) {&#10;  try {&#10;    await fetch(&#39;/api/tasks&#39;, { method: &#39;POST&#39;, body: JSON.stringify(task) });&#10;  } catch (err) {&#10;    // 网络失败时保存到 IndexedDB&#10;    await db.pending.add(task);&#10;    // 注册后台同步&#10;    const reg = await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;&#10;    await reg.sync.register(&#39;sync-tasks&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function postTask(task) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await fetch('/api/tasks', { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(task) });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  } catch (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 网络失败时保存到 IndexedDB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await db.pending.add(task);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 注册后台同步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const reg = await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await reg.sync.register('sync-tasks');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Service Worker 处理同步事件</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"self.addEventListener(&#39;sync&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.tag === &#39;sync-tasks&#39;) {&#10;    event.waitUntil(syncTasks());&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;&#10;async function syncTasks() {&#10;  const pending = await getAllPending();&#10;  for (const task of pending) {&#10;    try {&#10;      await fetch(&#39;/api/tasks&#39;, { method: &#39;POST&#39;, body: JSON.stringify(task) });&#10;      await deletePending(task.id);&#10;    } catch (err) {&#10;      // 抛出错误让浏览器稍后重试&#10;      throw err;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('sync', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (event.tag === 'sync-tasks') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event.waitUntil(syncTasks());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function syncTasks() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const pending = await getAllPending();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (const task of pending) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await fetch('/api/tasks', { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(task) });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await deletePending(task.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 抛出错误让浏览器稍后重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      throw err;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>浏览器重试机制</strong>：失败后浏览器会在之后自动重试；成功则标记完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"周期性后台同步\">周期性后台同步</h2><p><strong>用于定期刷新内容</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 检查权限并注册&#10;const reg = await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;&#10;const status = await navigator.permissions.query({ name: &#39;periodic-background-sync&#39; });&#10;if (status.state === &#39;granted&#39;) {&#10;  await reg.periodicSync.register(&#39;refresh-news&#39;, {&#10;    minInterval: 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000, // 最小间隔 1 天&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 检查权限并注册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const reg = await navigator.serviceWorker.ready;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const status = await navigator.permissions.query({ name: 'periodic-background-sync' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if (status.state === 'granted') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await reg.periodicSync.register('refresh-news', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    minInterval: 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000, // 最小间隔 1 天</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Service Worker 处理周期性同步事件</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"self.addEventListener(&#39;periodicsync&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.tag === &#39;refresh-news&#39;) {&#10;    event.waitUntil(refreshNews());&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('periodicsync', (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (event.tag === 'refresh-news') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    event.waitUntil(refreshNews());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意</strong>：浏览器根据用户使用频率自行决定实际触发间隔，并非精确按设定时间执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"workbox-backgroundsyncplugin\">Workbox BackgroundSyncPlugin</h2><p><strong>自动重试失败的 POST 请求</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { BackgroundSyncPlugin } from &#39;workbox-background-sync&#39;;&#10;import { registerRoute } from &#39;workbox-routing&#39;;&#10;import { NetworkOnly } from &#39;workbox-strategies&#39;;&#10;&#10;const bgSync = new BackgroundSyncPlugin(&#39;apiQueue&#39;, {&#10;  maxRetentionTime: 24 * 60, // 最长保留 24 小时&#10;});&#10;&#10;registerRoute(({ url }) =&gt; url.pathname.startsWith(&#39;/api/&#39;), new NetworkOnly({ plugins: [bgSync] }), &#39;POST&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { BackgroundSyncPlugin } from 'workbox-background-sync';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { registerRoute } from 'workbox-routing';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { NetworkOnly } from 'workbox-strategies';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const bgSync = new BackgroundSyncPlugin('apiQueue', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  maxRetentionTime: 24 * 60, // 最长保留 24 小时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>registerRoute(({ url }) => url.pathname.startsWith('/api/'), new NetworkOnly({ plugins: [bgSync] }), 'POST');</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>效果</strong>：POST 请求失败后自动进入队列，网络恢复时自动重试，最长保留 24 小时。Workbox 自动处理队列管理——存储和重试全部自动化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"使用场景\">使用场景</h2><p><strong>1. 离线提交表单</strong>：发推文、发评论、提交帖子——用户离线时写入内容，重新连接后自动提交。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 离线编辑文档</strong>：类似 Notion 的离线编辑体验，重连后同步变更。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 发送分析事件</strong>：离线期间产生的埋点事件排队等待，确保数据不丢失。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 周期性刷新内容</strong>：新闻应用每日获取最新内容、邮箱定期检查新邮件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户离线操作] --&gt; B[保存到 IndexedDB]&#10;    B --&gt; C[注册后台同步]&#10;    C --&gt; D[浏览器检测到网络恢复]&#10;    D --&gt; E[触发 Service Worker sync 事件]&#10;    E --&gt; F[处理 IndexedDB 中的待处理数据]&#10;    F --&gt; G{成功?}&#10;    G -- 是 --&gt; H[从队列中移除]&#10;    G -- 否 --&gt; I[抛出错误,稍后重试]&#10;    I --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[用户离线操作] --&gt; B[保存到 IndexedDB]\n    B --&gt; C[注册后台同步]\n    C --&gt; D[浏览器检测到网络恢复]\n    D --&gt; E[触发 Service Worker sync 事件]\n    E --&gt; F[处理 IndexedDB 中的待处理数据]\n    F --&gt; G{成功?}\n    G -- 是 --&gt; H[从队列中移除]\n    G -- 否 --&gt; I[抛出错误,稍后重试]\n    I --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"浏览器支持\">浏览器支持</h2><p><strong>Chrome / Edge</strong>：一次性同步和周期性同步均完整支持。周期性同步需要用户已安装 PWA 并有一定使用频率。</p>\n<p><strong>Firefox / Safari</strong>：目前不支持，需要使用回退方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"if (&#39;SyncManager&#39; in window) {&#10;  // 使用 Background Sync&#10;} else {&#10;  // 回退方案：监听 online 事件&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>if ('SyncManager' in window) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 使用 Background Sync</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 回退方案：监听 online 事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"回退方案\">回退方案</h2><p><strong>不支持 Background Sync 时的替代方案</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"window.addEventListener(&#39;online&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  syncPending();&#10;});&#10;&#10;async function syncPending() {&#10;  const pending = await db.pending.toArray();&#10;  for (const item of pending) {&#10;    try {&#10;      await fetch(&#39;/api/...&#39;, { ... });&#10;      await db.pending.delete(item.id);&#10;    } catch (err) {&#10;      console.error(&#39;同步失败&#39;, err);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>window.addEventListener('online', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  syncPending();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function syncPending() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const pending = await db.pending.toArray();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (const item of pending) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await fetch('/api/...', { ... });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      await db.pending.delete(item.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      console.error('同步失败', err);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>回退方案的局限</strong>：仅在页面打开时生效。如果用户关闭页面，则不会触发同步——这是与原生 Background Sync 的主要区别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限制与约束\">限制与约束</h2><p><strong>1. 有限的保留时间</strong>：浏览器可能在一段时间后丢弃待处理任务（Workbox 默认 24 小时）。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 触发时机不确定</strong>：浏览器自行决定何时触发同步事件。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 电量与隐私考虑</strong>：浏览器对后台活动较为保守。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 浏览器支持不完整</strong>：必须提供回退方案。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 周期性同步需要用户参与度</strong>：浏览器仅为已安装且活跃使用的 PWA 执行周期性同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大文件上传场景\">大文件上传场景</h2><p><strong>离线时保存文件到 IndexedDB，网络恢复后同步上传</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 保存文件到 IndexedDB&#10;await db.uploads.add({ file: bigFile, status: &#39;pending&#39; });&#10;&#10;// Service Worker 同步处理&#10;self.addEventListener(&#39;sync&#39;, async (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.tag === &#39;upload&#39;) {&#10;    const pending = await getAllPendingUploads();&#10;    for (const upload of pending) {&#10;      const formData = new FormData();&#10;      formData.append(&#39;file&#39;, upload.file);&#10;      try {&#10;        await fetch(&#39;/api/upload&#39;, { method: &#39;POST&#39;, body: formData });&#10;        await markComplete(upload.id);&#10;      } catch (err) {&#10;        throw err; // 让浏览器重试&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 保存文件到 IndexedDB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await db.uploads.add({ file: bigFile, status: 'pending' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Service Worker 同步处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('sync', async (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (event.tag === 'upload') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const pending = await getAllPendingUploads();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (const upload of pending) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const formData = new FormData();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      formData.append('file', upload.file);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        await fetch('/api/upload', { method: 'POST', body: formData });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        await markComplete(upload.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      } catch (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        throw err; // 让浏览器重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与同步队列的协作\">与同步队列的协作</h2><p><strong>同步队列是待处理操作的数据源</strong>，Background Sync 负责触发队列的处理流程：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同步队列存储在 IndexedDB 中，持久化所有待处理操作。</li>\n<li>Background Sync 在网络恢复时触发处理队列的逻辑。</li>\n<li>两者使用同一套逻辑，不要分开实现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"幂等性要求\">幂等性要求</h2><p><strong>重试安全是关键</strong>：操作可能被多次重试，服务器端必须保证幂等。</p>\n<p><strong>使用 UUID 标识每个操作</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"{&#10;  id: crypto.randomUUID(),&#10;  type: &#39;create_task&#39;,&#10;  data: { ... }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: crypto.randomUUID(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type: 'create_task',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data: { ... }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>服务器端处理</strong>：检查操作 ID 是否已处理过，跳过重复操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同步完成通知\">同步完成通知</h2><p><strong>同步成功后可选择通知用户</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"self.addEventListener(&#39;sync&#39;, async (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.tag === &#39;sync-tasks&#39;) {&#10;    await syncTasks();&#10;&#10;    // 通知用户&#10;    await self.registration.showNotification(&#39;同步完成！&#39;, {&#10;      body: &#39;你的任务已全部同步到服务器&#39;,&#10;      icon: &#39;/icon-192.png&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>self.addEventListener('sync', async (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (event.tag === 'sync-tasks') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await syncTasks();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 通知用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    await self.registration.showNotification('同步完成！', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      body: '你的任务已全部同步到服务器',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      icon: '/icon-192.png',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>注意</strong>：不要过度通知，保持克制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"防重放保护\">防重放保护</h2><p><strong>服务器端防重放</strong>：跟踪已处理的操作 ID，拒绝重复提交。对于关键操作（如支付）尤为重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试后台同步\">测试后台同步</h2><p><strong>Chrome DevTools 测试方法</strong>：在 Application 标签页 → Service Workers → 点击&quot;Sync&quot;按钮手动触发同步事件。</p>\n<p><strong>测试步骤</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 DevTools 中设置离线模式。</li>\n<li>执行表单提交等操作。</li>\n<li>验证数据已进入队列。</li>\n<li>手动触发同步（DevTools Sync 按钮）。</li>\n<li>验证数据已处理并从队列移除。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"常见反模式\">常见反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 不提供回退方案</strong>：Safari 用户静默失败。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 操作不保证幂等</strong>：重试导致重复数据。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 无限重试</strong>：浪费资源，应设置保留时间上限。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 不显示待同步状态</strong>：用户不知道离线变更正在等待同步。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 崩溃时丢失同步队列</strong>：未将队列持久化到 IndexedDB。</p>\n<p><strong>6. 周期性同步频率过高</strong>：消耗电量，浏览器可能限制执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><p><strong>1. 使用 Workbox BackgroundSyncPlugin</strong>：简单可靠，经过充分测试。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 将队列持久化到 IndexedDB</strong>：确保应用崩溃后数据不丢失。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 服务器端保证幂等</strong>：使用 UUID 和去重逻辑。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 显示待同步状态</strong>：让用户知道&quot;正在保存…&quot;、&quot;等待同步&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 同步成功后确认</strong>：显示&quot;已发送 ✓&quot;的状态反馈。</p>\n<p><strong>6. 测试真实离线场景</strong>：使用真实离线加重连环境验证完整流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战案例\">实战案例</h2><p><strong>Twitter PWA</strong>：离线发推文后注册同步任务，重连后自动发布，用户几乎无感知差异。</p>\n<p><strong>Linear</strong>：离线编辑事项（Issue），重连后自动同步变更。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Background Sync API 让 PWA 在离线时注册同步任务，浏览器在网络恢复后自动触发 Service Worker 处理（即使页面已关闭）。一次性同步通过 <code>reg.sync.register(&#39;tag&#39;)</code> 注册，Service Worker 监听 <code>sync</code> 事件处理，失败自动重试。周期性同步通过 <code>reg.periodicSync.register()</code> 设置最小间隔，需要 PWA 已安装且用户有使用频率。Workbox BackgroundSyncPlugin 提供开箱即用的 POST 请求自动重试能力。关键实践包括：同步队列持久化到 IndexedDB 防止数据丢失、服务器端保证幂等防止重复操作、提供不支持浏览器的回退方案、向用户展示待同步状态以建立信任。Background Sync 是 PWA 可靠性的关键保障——做对了离线操作不丢失，做不对则用户工作付之东流。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"后台同步","id":"后台同步"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一次性后台同步","id":"一次性后台同步"},{"level":2,"text":"周期性后台同步","id":"周期性后台同步"},{"level":2,"text":"Workbox BackgroundSyncPlugin","id":"workbox-backgroundsyncplugin"},{"level":2,"text":"使用场景","id":"使用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"浏览器支持","id":"浏览器支持"},{"level":2,"text":"回退方案","id":"回退方案"},{"level":2,"text":"限制与约束","id":"限制与约束"},{"level":2,"text":"大文件上传场景","id":"大文件上传场景"},{"level":2,"text":"与同步队列的协作","id":"与同步队列的协作"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等性要求","id":"幂等性要求"},{"level":2,"text":"同步完成通知","id":"同步完成通知"},{"level":2,"text":"防重放保护","id":"防重放保护"},{"level":2,"text":"测试后台同步","id":"测试后台同步"},{"level":2,"text":"常见反模式","id":"常见反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"实战案例","id":"实战案例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"同步策略与冲突解决","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/offline-data/sync-strategies-and-conflict"},"next":{"title":"离线状态用户体验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/offline-data/offline-state-ux"}}